mportant is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 12, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": "", "id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "image": "", "id": 0}], "video_src": "enpe7n3le02ob12re5vsc01"}, "type": "video"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "id": 3, "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "enpe7n3le02ob12re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"time": "0", "text": "<div align=\"justify\">A Decision Support System (DSS) is a computer application; this application provides access to fundamental information. Companies can analyze this data in order to make decisions for their daily business. This is why we could also think of DSS as some kind of computer assistance to management.<br><br>We are going to have a careful look at this topic. Let's go back to the origins of DSS, back in the 1950's. Engineers were working on operational analysis and theory of organizations, and were developing the first interactive computer systems. Are you following the timeline?<br>", "image": "enpe7n3le02ob12re2img01.jpg", "id": 0}, {"time": "37500", "text": "<div align=\"justify\">What I want to clarify here is that people are working on the research and development of DSS nowadays, but this started some time ago. In the 60's, scientists started a more systematic and analytical research on DSS, and included the idea of \u201chuman-computer symbiosis\u201d for problem solving. How much data can a Decision Support System store? We could think of a DSS as one or more large databases, whose data might be stored from transactions, online news services, and other sources. We are not going to mention all of them, because there are too many. Other tasks that DSS handles include data analysis, management of rule-based systems, and of interactive models. If the DSS of a company is well designed, the user can interact with all these elements with ease.<br>", "image": "enpe7n3le02ob12re2img02.jpg", "id": 1}, {"time": "88300", "text": "<div align=\"justify\">As you can see, Decision Support Systems are very useful computer applications that facilitate analytic and decision-making processes in a company. Businesses and companies have to understand the way a DSS could be used in their projects. Data management is a very important aspect when talking about investments and projects. We, as software developers, can't ignore the most important facts about this topic.", "image": "enpe7n3le02ob12re2img03.jpg", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe7n3le02ob12re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar"}]}